@startuml avatar-crop-lifecycle
title Avatar Crop Lifecycle — Root Cause Analysis
skinparam backgroundColor #1a1a2e
skinparam defaultFontColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #667eea
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #667eea
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #16213e
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #667eea
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #e74c3c
skinparam noteFontColor white

actor User
participant "rb-avatar\n(overlay)" as Overlay
participant "RawBinClient" as Client
participant "Server\nUPDATE_PROFILE" as Server
participant "UserProfile\n(in-memory)" as Profile
participant "rb-avatar\n(all instances)" as Avatars

== User Pinch-Zoom + Tap Crop ==

User -> Overlay : pinchZoom (JS touch events)
note right: scale, tx, ty tracked\nin overlay state

User -> Overlay : tap "Crop" button
Overlay -> Client : ws.send({ type: UPDATE_PROFILE,\n  avatarCrop: {scale, x, y} })
note right #ff9800: **No avatar field sent**\n(only avatarCrop)

Overlay -> Overlay : setAttribute('crop', JSON.stringify(crop))
Overlay -> Overlay : closeOverlay()
Overlay -> Avatars : window.dispatchEvent('rb-avatar-updated',\n  { token, crop })  **NO url**

== Server Processes ==

Client -> Server : UPDATE_PROFILE message
Server -> Profile : profile.avatarCrop = {scale, x, y}
note right: profile.avatar is **NOT** touched\n(no msg.avatar in message)

Server -> Client : PROFILE_UPDATED { profile:\n  { avatar: "/api/avatar/...",\n    avatarCrop: {scale, x, y} } }

Server -> Avatars : MEMBER_JOINED broadcast\n{ avatarUrl: profile.avatar,\n  avatarCrop: profile.avatarCrop }

== Client Receives PROFILE_UPDATED ==

Client -> Client : _profile = msg.profile
Client -> Avatars : window.dispatchEvent('rb-avatar-updated',\n  { token, url: profile.avatar, crop: profile.avatarCrop })

Avatars -> Avatars : setAttribute('src', url + '?t=...')
note right #e74c3c: **CACHE BUST** forces\nimg reload

Avatars -> Avatars : setAttribute('crop', JSON.stringify(crop))
Avatars -> Avatars : render()

== BUG 1: Crop Transform Displaces Image ==

note over Avatars #e74c3c
**ROOT CAUSE 1: Visual displacement**
render() applies: transform:scale(S) translate(Xpx, Ypx)
on the <img> INSIDE a small circular overflow:hidden container.

The overlay image is ~90vw wide. The circular avatar is 24-80px.
translate(X,Y) values from the large overlay are HUGE relative
to the tiny circular container.

Example: overlay image 300px wide, user pans 50px right.
tx=50. In a 24px badge, translate(50px,0) pushes the
image completely out of the circle → shows background → R fallback.

**FIX: Scale tx/ty relative to container size, not absolute pixels.**
end note

== BUG 2: Crop Not Restored ==

note over Avatars #e74c3c
**ROOT CAUSE 2: Missing crop attribute**
rb-member-badge creates <rb-avatar> with src and name
but does NOT pass crop attribute.
Neither does RoomBrowser lobby avatar.
ProfileEditor does not pass crop either.

crop data exists in profile but is never propagated
to the initial rb-avatar attribute at creation time.

**FIX: Pass crop from profile/member data to rb-avatar.**
end note

@enduml
